ReproBreak-derived data
-----------------------
data/distributions/reprobreak_changes.json contains aggregate counts computed
by src/selector_heal/reprobreak.py from locator_analysis.csv in ReproBreak:

  ReproBreak: A Dataset of Reproducible Web Locator Breaks (ASE 2026)
  https://github.com/rub-sq/ReproBreak (commit c603a0c)
  https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21171968

