Base model
----------
No model weights or adapters are included. The training code fine-tunes
Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct), which is
distributed by Alibaba Cloud under the Qwen Research License Agreement.

